### Contact Management API - HTTP Test Requests
### Compatible with REST Client (VS Code) & Thunder Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contactId = 1
@addressId = 1

### 👤 USER & AUTHENTICATION APIS (docs/user.md)

### 1. Register User
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "jymnastiar",
  "password": "secretpassword",
  "name": "Fadhli Gymnastiar"
}

###

### 2. Login User
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "jymnastiar",
  "password": "secretpassword"
}

### Simpan token dari response login secara otomatis (atau ganti jika manual)
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

###

### 3. Get Current User Profile
# @name getCurrentUser
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/current
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Update Current User Profile
# @name updateUser
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/current
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Fadhli Gymnastiar",
  "password": "newsecretpassword"
}

###

### 5. Refresh Access Token (Requires Cookie)
# @name refreshToken
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/current/token
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Logout User (Clears Cookie and Revokes Token)
# @name logoutUser
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/current
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### 📇 CONTACT APIS (docs/contact.md)
### ==============================================================================

### 1. Create Contact
# @name createContact
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Fadhli",
  "last_name": "Gymnastiar",
  "email": "jymnastiar@example.com",
  "phone": "089999999"
}

###

### 2. Search / List Contacts (with pagination & filters)
# @name searchContacts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contacts?name=Fadhli&phone=089999999&page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Get Contact by ID
# @name getContact
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Update Contact
# @name updateContact
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Fadhli",
  "last_name": "Gymnastiar",
  "email": "jymnastiar_updated@example.com",
  "phone": "089999999"
}

###

### 5. Remove Contact
# @name removeContact
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### 🏠 ADDRESS APIS (docs/address.md)
### ==============================================================================

### 1. Create Address for Contact
# @name createAddress
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contacts/{{contactId}}/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "street": "Jalan Mawar No. 12",
  "city": "Bandung",
  "province": "Jawa Barat",
  "country": "Indonesia",
  "postal_code": "40115"
}

###

### 2. List Addresses for Contact
# @name listAddresses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contacts/{{contactId}}/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Get Address by ID
# @name getAddress
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contacts/{{contactId}}/addresses/{{addressId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Update Address
# @name updateAddress
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/contacts/{{contactId}}/addresses/{{addressId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "street": "Jalan Perubahan No. 99",
  "city": "Surabaya",
  "province": "Jawa Timur",
  "country": "Indonesia",
  "postal_code": "60111"
}

###

### 5. Remove Address
# @name removeAddress
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/contacts/{{contactId}}/addresses/{{addressId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json